Core Capabilities
- Unified volume control for all output devices with a single slider.
- Instant hotkey mapping for mute, increase, and decrease actions.
- Profile manager to save and switch between custom sound configurations.
- Command‑line interface for automation scripts and remote deployment.
- Real‑time device detection and auto‑reassign when headphones or speakers are plugged in.

